ua Simulacra","r":[0.1093,0.2467,0.0519,0.0415],"k":"w"},{"n":"Elegy for the End","r":[0.1093,0.3119,0.0519,0.0415],"k":"w"},{"n":"Emblem of Severed Fate","r":[0.0815,0.4304,0.0519,0.0415],"k":"a"},{"n":"Emblem of Severed Fate","r":[0.0815,0.4956,0.0519,0.0415],"k":"a"},{"n":"Tenacity of the Millelith","r":[0.1389,0.4956,0.0519,0.0415],"k":"a"},{"n":"Heart of Depth","r":[0.0815,0.5607,0.0519,0.0415],"k":"a"},{"n":"Tenacity of the Millelith","r":[0.1389,0.5607,0.0519,0.0415],"k":"a"},{"n":"Yelan","r":[0.0815,0.6748,0.0407,0.0326]},{"n":"Arlecchino","r":[0.1296,0.6748,0.0407,0.0326]},{"n":"Bennett","r":[0.1778,0.6748,0.0407,0.0326]},{"n":"Xilonen","r":[0.2259,0.6748,0.0407,0.0326]},{"n":"Yelan","r":[0.0815,0.7326,0.0407,0.0326]},{"n":"Hu Tao","r":[0.1296,0.7326,0.0407,0.0326]},{"n":"Xingqiu","r":[0.1778,0.7326,0.0407,0.0326]},{"n":"Zhongli","r":[0.2259,0.7326,0.0407,0.0326]},{"n":"Yelan","r":[0.0815,0.7904,0.0407,0.0326]},{"n":"Alhaitham","r":[0.1296,0.7904,0.0407,0.0326]},{"n":"Nahida","r":[0.1778,0.7904,0.0407,0.0326]},{"n":"Kuki Shinobu","r":[0.2259,0.7904,0.0407,0.0326]},{"n":"Yelan","r":[0.0815,0.8556,0.0407,0.0326]},{"n":"Raiden Shogun","r":[0.1296,0.8556,0.0407,0.0326]},{"n":"Xiangling","r":[0.1778,0.8556,0.0407,0.0326]},{"n":"Bennett","r":[0.2259,0.8556,0.0407,0.0326]}]}]}},"thumb":"content/genshin/builds/yelan/261111-225430/en-1.t.webp","why":{"w":[{"name":"Aqua Simulacra","text":"Huge CRIT DMG, HP bonus, and off-field damage boost. Best for personal damage when her Energy needs are met. Requires sufficient ER from artifacts, teammates, or C1."},{"name":"Elegy for the End","text":"ER supports Burst uptime while the teamwide EM and ATK buff improves reaction-focused teams. Best when teammates benefit from EM/ATK; trades Yelan damage for team buffs."},{"name":"Favonius Warbow","text":"Massive ER and neutral particles keep her Burst ready and lower team Energy needs. Use enough CRIT Rate to activate its passive reliably."},{"name":"Sacrificial Bow","text":"Can reset her Skill for extra Hydro particles and damage, but extends rotations and is less reliable than Favonius. Catch particles from both Skills. R3+ preferred."},{"name":"Mouun's Moon","text":"Boosts Burst damage based on the team’s combined Burst costs; best with low ER requirements. Needs ER from team and artifacts. R3-R5 preferred."},{"name":"The Stringless","text":"Boosts Skill and Burst damage; EM is less useful outside reaction-triggering situations. Use when her Burst is already funded. R5 preferred."},{"name":"Fading Twilight","text":"Provides ER and a rotating damage bonus, making it a workable event alternative. Event-exclusive; cannot currently be obtained."},{"name":"Slingshot","text":"Large CRIT Rate stat stick; Normal Attack passive does not boost her Burst. Only when energy needs are solved by her team."}],"a":[{"names":["Emblem of Severed Fate"],"text":"Best general set: 20% ER plus Burst DMG scaling with ER. Do not overstack ER past her rotation requirement.","stats":"ER%/HP% · Hydro DMG%/HP% · CRIT"},{"names":["Emblem of Severed Fate","Tenacity of the Millelith"],"text":"Accessible interim mix of ER and HP for reliable Bursts; weaker damage than 4pc Emblem.","stats":"ER%/HP% · Hydro DMG% · CRIT"},{"names":["Heart of Depth","Tenacity of the Millelith"],"text":"Low-ER transition set with Hydro DMG and HP bonuses; mainly when strong Emblem pieces are unavailable.","stats":"HP%/ER% · Hydro DMG% · CRIT"}],"t":[{"name":"Vape and Vanish","members":["Yelan","Arlecchino","Bennett","Xilonen"],"text":"Yelan applies off-field Hydro for Arlecchino to Vaporize. Bennett supplies ATK; Xilonen shreds RES and buffs damage.","roles":["Sub DPS","Main DPS","Buffer / Healer","Support"]},{"name":"Double Trouble","members":["Yelan","Hu Tao","Xingqiu","Zhongli"],"text":"Yelan and Xingqiu supply steady Hydro for Hu Tao’s Vaporize attacks; Zhongli protects the team and reduces enemy RES.","roles":["Sub DPS","Main DPS","Sub DPS","Shield"]},{"name":"Bloom Service","members":["Yelan","Alhaitham","Nahida","Kuki Shinobu"],"text":"Yelan’s Hydro and Nahida’s Dendro form cores; full-EM Kuki triggers Hyperbloom while Alhaitham drives Dendro damage.","roles":["Sub DPS","Main DPS","Support","Healer / Trigger"]},{"name":"National Security","members":["Yelan","Raiden Shogun","Xiangling","Bennett"],"text":"Raiden restores team Energy and helps stabilize Hydro aura for Xiangling’s Vaporizes; Bennett boosts Xiangling and heals.","roles":["Sub DPS","Main DPS / Battery","Sub DPS","Buffer / Healer"]}],"v":"Team Buffer: Elegy for the End trades Yelan’s personal damage for teamwide EM and ATK buffs in reaction teams.\nHigh ER / Solo Hydro: Favonius Warbow + 4pc Emblem; prioritize enough ER to Burst every rotation before HP and CRIT.\nDouble Hydro: With a Hydro battery or C1, reduce ER as needed and shift substats toward HP and CRIT.\nC6 On-field: At C6, invest in Breakthrough Barb damage and on-field time; Normal Attack talent gains value.","n":2},"seo":{"roles":["Sub DPS"],"about":"Yelan is an HP-scaling off-field Hydro DPS whose Burst follows Normal Attacks to apply Hydro and deal strong single-target damage. She also ramps up the active character’s damage bonus. Prioritize enough Energy Recharge to Burst every rotation; ATK does not increase her Skill or Burst damage.","pros":["Strong off-field damage","Reliable Hydro application","Active-character DMG buff","Flexible reaction teams"],"cons":["High solo-Hydro ER needs","Mostly single-target","Needs Normal Attack triggers","No defensive utility"],"weapons":["Aqua Simulacra","Elegy for the End","Favonius Warbow","Sacrificial Bow","Mouun's Moon","The Stringless","Fading Twilight","Slingshot"],"arts":[{"sets":["Emblem of Severed Fate"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":""},{"sets":["Emblem of Severed Fate","Tenacity of the Millelith"],"pcs":"2 + 2 pcs","role":""},{"sets":["Heart of Depth","Tenacity of the Millelith"],"pcs":"2 + 2 pcs","role":""}],"main":["Energy Recharge / HP%","Hydro DMG% / HP%","CRIT Rate / CRIT DMG / HP%"],"stats":["HP: 30,000 - 40,000+","CRIT Rate: 65% - 80%","CRIT DMG: 130% - 180%+","ER: 215% - 260%","ER (Fav, double Hydro): 110% - 195%"],"vars":[{"title":"Team Buff (Elegy)","role":"Off-field Support","weapons":["Elegy for the End","Favonius Warbow"],"arts":[{"sets":["Emblem of Severed Fate"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Maintain rotation ER first. HP and CRIT remain useful but teammate damage matters more than Yelan’s personal ceiling.","teams":"Best with an ATK- or EM-scaling reaction carry such as Arlecchino or Hu Tao.","when":"Use Elegy when its teamwide ATK/EM buff adds more damage than Aqua’s personal damage advantage.","cond":"Team must benefit from Elegy buffs.","notes":"Elegy buffs teammates; it does not make Yelan an ATK-scaling character.","pre":false},{"title":"High ER / Solo Hydro","role":"Off-field DPS","weapons":["Favonius Warbow","Sacrificial Bow","Fading Twilight"],"arts":[{"sets":["Emblem of Severed Fate"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"ER Sands is often needed; with 1 Skill and Favonius, solo-Hydro ER can reach ~215–260%. Build CRIT Rate for Favonius.","teams":"Yelan is the only Hydro unit and has limited external battery support.","when":"Use when missing even one Burst would cost more damage than upgrading HP or CRIT.","cond":"ER needs drop with 2 Skill uses, Raiden, and Favonius teammates.","notes":"ER numbers are scenario estimates, not universal stat requirements.","pre":false},{"title":"Double Hydro / Low ER","role":"Off-field DPS","weapons":["Aqua Simulacra","Mouun's Moon","The Stringless","Slingshot"],"arts":[{"sets":["Emblem of Severed Fate"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Heart of Depth","Tenacity of the Millelith"],"pcs":"2 + 2 pcs"}],"stats":"Use HP% Sands when ER is met; aim for HP, CRIT and Hydro DMG rather than stacking excess ER.","teams":"A second Hydro character, C1, or strong external particles should fund her Burst.","when":"Use for stronger personal damage in lower-ER teams, especially with Xingqiu or Furina.","cond":"Only when she can Burst every rotation.","notes":"Normal Attack triggers are still necessary for Burst coordinated attacks.","pre":false},{"title":"C6 On-field Burst Window","role":"On-field DPS","weapons":["Aqua Simulacra","Slingshot"],"arts":[{"sets":["Emblem of Severed Fate"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Her C6 Breakthrough Barbs make Normal Attack talent investment relevant; balance HP, CRIT and enough ER.","teams":"Requires Yelan C6; support buffs should cover her opening on-field damage window.","when":"For C6 owners using her frontloaded Breakthrough Barb attacks instead of a purely off-field role.","cond":"C6 only.","notes":"Do not recommend upgrading Normal Attack talent for ordinary C0 off-field builds.","pre":false}],"mats":["Varunada Lazurite Sliver","Varunada Lazurite Fragment","Varunada Lazurite Chunk","Varunada Lazurite Gemstone","Runic Fang","Teachings of Prosperity","Guide to Prosperity","Philosophies of Prosperity","Recruit's Insignia","Sergeant's Insignia","Lieutenant's Insignia","Starconch","Gilded Scale","Crown of Insight","Mora","Hero's Wit"],"talents":[{"name":"Normal Attack","pri":"Level 1+"},{"name":"Elemental Skill","pri":"Level 8-9"},{"name":"Elemental Burst","pri":"Level 8-9"}],"teams":[{"name":"Vape and Vanish","members":["Yelan","Arlecchino","Bennett","Xilonen"]},{"name":"Double Trouble","members":["Yelan","Hu Tao","Xingqiu","Zhongli"]},{"name":"Bloom Service","members":["Yelan","Alhaitham","Nahida","Kuki Shinobu"]},{"name":"National Security","members":["Yelan","Raiden Shogun","Xiangling","Bennett"]}]}}],"title":"Yelan","el":"Hydro"}